# Domain & solver

- Shared TS contract for Edge and local: `solve` then `run_mutations`.
- Duals always in `solve` result; status `done | rejected_too_large | accepted`.
- `model.schema_version` required; do not bump while AGENTS forbids compat.
- `what_if_defaults` live on model snapshot; children store `mutation` only (no live template link).
- Full table rules: `docs/data-model.md`.
